# Frontend design

Read `docs/design.md` before changing the interface. Tokens live in `src/styles/tokens.css`.

- Charcoal room `#202223`, ivory text `#f1efe8`, one brass accent `#d0b27a`.
- Brass is only for selection, keyboard focus, progress, and the primary action.
- `--line` divides. `--field-edge` outlines controls. Disabled text stays at full opacity.
- Sentence case. Schibsted Grotesk. Hit targets are at least 44px.
- A mouse click must not leave the brass focus ring. Keyboard focus keeps it.
- Keep the Staunton set, the two-grey board, and the current lighting. No wood grain, file labels, or orbit controls.
- Show only real PGN or API data. Do not invent ratings, accuracy, or charts.
